msgid ""
"The first example shows how to compute the ground state energy for an NH3 "
"molecule using the HI-VQE algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"El primer ejemplo muestra cómo calcular la energía del estado fundamental de"
" una molécula de NH3 usando el algoritmo HI-VQE.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define the molecular geometry and options {#define-the-molecular-geometry-"
"and-options}"
msgstr ""
"Definir la geometría molecular y las opciones {#define-the-molecular-"
"geometry-and-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The molecular geometry of NH3 is provided with Cartesian coordinates "
